  "description": "The PDF writer for DocWright: draws laid-out pages (from Word documents, Excel workbooks or SSRS reports) as PDF 1.7 in a single pass, with TrueType and CFF font subsetting, hyperlinks, outline, tagged PDF and PDF/A-2b. Deterministic: the same input renders byte-identically every time. Installed automatically by DocWright and DocWright.Spreadsheet.Rendering. For reading, rasterizing or assembling existing PDFs, see DocWright.Formats.Pdf.",
